# The two data/ files the existing rules miss (2026-08-23). `data/painpoints.db`
# and `data/raw/` were covered; these were not, so the whole data/ directory
# showed as untracked and a `git add -A` would have committed the scrape cache
# and the trend snapshot as if they were source. Both are regenerable by
# scripts/ai_trends.py and the candidate pass.
data/ai_trends.json
data/_existing_candidates.json
